Subject: Cantor Supervised Mock Loop Activation

Description: Implementation authority for one deterministic, effect-free supervised ecosystem cycle that proves commission, addressed messaging, Cantor delegation, candidate review, replay defense, and bounded termination before any live Codex integration.

